{
  "schema": "clinicalcraft/room-template@1",
  "id": "sc-or-hybrid",
  "name": {"zh-CN": "复合手术室（机器人血管造影）", "en": "Hybrid OR (robotic angiography)"},
  "description": {"zh-CN": "11 × 9 m（99 m²）复合手术室：机器人落地式血管造影 C 形臂、可透 X 线的碳纤维浮动手术床、3.2 × 3.2 m Ⅰ级层流天花、吊顶铅屏风与床旁铅帘、高压注射器、体外循环机待命、经食道超声；西侧墙为带铅玻璃观察窗的控制室。适用于 TAVI、腔内修复（EVAR/TEVAR）、复合神经血管与创伤手术。防护按医学物理师的屏蔽计算（常见 1.5–3 mm 铅当量）。", "en": "11 × 9 m (99 m²) hybrid OR: robotic floor-mounted angiography C-arm, radiolucent carbon-fibre floating table, a 3.2 × 3.2 m Class I laminar ceiling, ceiling lead shield and table-side lead curtain, contrast injector, a heart-lung machine on standby and TOE ultrasound; the west wall is the control room's lead-glass window. For TAVI, EVAR/TEVAR, hybrid neurovascular and trauma surgery. Shielding follows the medical physicist's calculation (commonly 1.5–3 mm lead equivalent)."},
  "kind": "operating-room",
  "size": {"w": 11, "d": 9},
  "floor": "sc-or-floor",
  "partitions": [
    {"side": "n", "material": "sc-or-wall", "base": "sc-or-wall-base", "height": 4.6, "openings": [{"kind": "sliding-door", "offset": 3.4, "width": 1.6, "height": 2.6}]},
    {"side": "w", "material": "sc-or-wall", "base": "sc-or-wall-base", "height": 4.6, "openings": [{"kind": "window", "offset": 0, "width": 3, "sill": 1, "height": 1.3}, {"kind": "sliding-door", "offset": 3, "width": 1.4, "height": 2.4}]},
    {"side": "e", "material": "sc-or-wall", "base": "sc-or-wall-base", "height": 4.6, "openings": [{"kind": "sliding-door", "offset": 3.1, "width": 1.4, "height": 2.6}, {"kind": "sliding-door", "offset": -1.2, "width": 1.4, "height": 2.6}]},
    {"side": "s", "material": "sc-or-wall", "base": "sc-or-wall-base", "height": 4.6, "openings": [{"kind": "sliding-door", "offset": -2.4, "width": 2.4, "height": 3}]}
  ],
